  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported GetStaadFileNameOnly, GetAnlFileFullPath, GetOpenedStaadFilename, IsTarget and ModelIsOpen with complete matching XML IntelliSense. Preserved one native filename read per helper, blank versus malformed output, uppercase .ANL derivation and normalized full-path comparison. Added consistent relative-path comparison and retained thread, binding, disposal and reentrancy guards. Fifteen common Root contracts are now implemented; other domains remain pending.",
